{"about_the_game":"Dashgunner is a single player FPS with stylized graphics and high mobility fast-paced gameplay. Player can grapple, slide, dash and traverse freely across various levels while engage in high-speed combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/3209e952c7e8fbb2da364862b32d6978.poster.avif?t=1727615711\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/3209e952c7e8fbb2da364862b32d6978.webm?t=1727615711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/3209e952c7e8fbb2da364862b32d6978.mp4?t=1727615711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game provides a series of campaign mission with open levels that player traverses freely, complete mission objectives and engage enemies with unique abilities. Player can also further adjust loadout with different weapon and ability upgrade to fine-tune their gameplay and tactic.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/591256828d91d162552baccedc59b6c8.poster.avif?t=1727615711\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/591256828d91d162552baccedc59b6c8.webm?t=1727615711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516510/extras/591256828d91d162552baccedc59b6c8.mp4?t=1727615711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br>-\tFast-paced high mobility FPS gameplay<br>-\tSeries of campaign mission with semi-open level that allow the player to traverse freely in whatever way they want.<br>-\tArena and tournament game mo